I found relevant information about the DayZ Sakhal DLC mission template and serverDZ.cfg configuration. Here are the key findings:

## Mission Template Configuration

To load the Sakhal mission on server startup, you set `template="dayzOffline.sakhal"` in the serverDZ.cfg file.

## Where It Goes in serverDZ.cfg

The official mission folders are set as template in serverDZ.cfg under the Missions class structure. The standard format is:

```
class Missions {
    class DayZ {
        template = "dayzOffline.sakhal";
    };
};
```

## Key Points

- Sakhal is an 83 km² arctic Russian island that requires the Frostline DLC on clients
- The mission folder for Sakhal is located at `mpmissions/dayzOffline.sakhal/`
- Persistence doesn't carry across missions — expect a fresh world when you switch

The GitHub repositories I found (Andrew-InTheBox/DayZServerSakhal) contain example configurations showing this setup in practice.


